---
description: marketsim project rules — always follow AGENTS.md and work one task card at a time
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- Follow `marketsim/AGENTS.md` (this package). It is authoritative for design rules, workflow and definition of done.
- Work exactly one task card from `claude/plan/*.md` per session; pick it from `claude/plan/PROGRESS.md`.
- Before coding read the card's **Read first** sections; conventions are in `claude/plan/00-MASTER-PLAN.md` §6–§8.
- If a card is ambiguous or a required test cannot pass without changing the economics, stop and write to
  `claude/plan/QUESTIONS.md`. Never loosen a tolerance or edit a test to get green.
- All parameters go in `config/*.yaml` with a pydantic model. Randomness only via `core.rng.stream(name)`.
